### Azure Static Web Apps API Endpoints Test

@apiHost = http://localhost:7071

### Get Gruppenstunden
GET {{apiHost}}/api/gruppenstunden
Accept: application/json

### Get Vorstand
GET {{apiHost}}/api/vorstand
Accept: application/json

### Get Leitende
GET {{apiHost}}/api/leitende
Accept: application/json

### Get Aktionen
GET {{apiHost}}/api/aktionen
Accept: application/json

### Get Aktionen ICS
GET {{apiHost}}/api/aktionen.ics
Accept: text/calendar

### Get Leitende ICS
GET {{apiHost}}/api/leitende.ics
Accept: text/calendar

### Get Blog Entries
GET {{apiHost}}/api/blog
Accept: application/json

### Get Download Files
GET {{apiHost}}/api/downloads
Accept: application/json

### Get Leitende Image
# Replace {id} with an actual Leitende ID, e.g., from the /api/leitende endpoint
@leitendeId = your-leitende-id
GET {{apiHost}}/api/leitende/{{leitendeId}}/image
Accept: image/jpeg

### Get Blog Image
# Replace {id} with an actual Blog ID, e.g., from the /api/blog endpoint
@blogId = your-blog-id
GET {{apiHost}}/api/blog/{{blogId}}/image
Accept: image/jpeg

### Get Download File Image
# Replace {id} with an actual Download ID, e.g., from the /api/downloads endpoint
# Replace {size} with one of: large, medium, small
@downloadId = your-download-id
@imageSize = medium
GET {{apiHost}}/api/downloads/{{downloadId}}/image/{{imageSize}}
Accept: image/jpeg

### Get Download File
# Replace {id} with an actual Download ID, e.g., from the /api/downloads endpoint
@downloadFileId = your-download-file-id
GET {{apiHost}}/api/downloads/{{downloadFileId}}/file
Accept: application/octet-stream

### Nikolaus: Get slot availability
GET {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/slots
Accept: application/json

### Nikolaus: Create booking (sends the confirmation mail)
POST {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyName": "Mustermann",
  "email": "max@example.org",
  "phone": "0171 1234567",
  "slot": "2026-12-05T17:00",
  "withKrampus": true,
  "website": ""
}

### Nikolaus: Manage booking (token from the link in the mail)
@nikolausToken = token-from-mail
POST {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/manage/lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{nikolausToken}}" }

### Nikolaus: Confirm booking
POST {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/manage/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{nikolausToken}}" }

### Nikolaus: Update booking details
POST {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/manage/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{nikolausToken}}",
  "familyName": "Mustermann",
  "email": "max@example.org",
  "phone": "0171 1234567",
  "withKrampus": false
}

### Nikolaus: Reschedule booking to another slot
POST {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/manage/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{nikolausToken}}", "slot": "2026-12-06T18:00" }

### Nikolaus: Request a new management link (invalidates the previous one)
POST {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/manage/resend-link
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "max@example.org", "website": "" }

### Nikolaus: Cancel booking
POST {{apiHost}}/api/nikolaus/manage/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{nikolausToken}}" }
